 In this role, you combine operational leadership with an active presence on the work floor. Approximately half of your time will be dedicated to planning, coordination, and alignment, while the other half will be spent working alongside your team in the greenhouse or in the field. You will report to the Station Manager in Enkhuizen and work closely with breeders, R&D Operations colleagues, and various internal stakeholders.
 In this role, you will be responsible for:
 Leading, coaching, and further developing a team of permanent and seasonal employees;
 Managing crop production and workforce activities at the site;
 Ensuring quality, safety, and operational efficiency within the daily operation;
 Maintaining close collaboration with breeders, commercial teams, and colleagues across R&D Operations;
 Actively contributing to greenhouse and field activities as a working supervisor;
 Identifying and implementing improvements in processes, facilities, and ways of working.
