Strong research and breeding innovation starts with reliable data and insightful analysis. In this role as Assistant Researcher Bioinformatics, you will support the Biotechnology Research department by transforming large-scale genomics datasets that will generate valuable insights for breeding programs. Working closely with molecular biologists and bioinformatics colleagues, you will help optimize data workflows and ensure high-quality analysis results. This is how you contribute to the development of innovative vegetable varieties that help shape the future of sustainable agriculture.
