 Performing quality control and curation of genomics datasets;
 Maintaining, optimizing, and executing bioinformatics analysis workflows;
 Developing new workflows and tools for genomics data analysis;
 Supporting molecular biologists performing genomic data analysis;
 Working with large-scale sequence data in high-performance computing environments;
 Contributing to continuous improvements in data management, analysis methods, and research processes.
